error[NK1296]: `+` is not a lane operation, and this is a `simd::Fixed[u32, 4]`.
   --> tests/simd_float_lanes_refused.nika:20:19
    |
 20 |     let added = i + i
    |                   ^^^
    |
    = note: A lane's `+` would either check every lane, which costs the compare and branch the vector exists to avoid, or wrap, which `+` never does elsewhere in Nikaia (ADR-377 D4).
    = help: Name what a lane does where the result does not fit: `a.wrapping_add(b)` wraps, `a.saturating_add(b)` stops at the nearest value a lane holds.
